==Format==
* '''Opening Stage:''' ''November 30<sup>th</sup> - December 3<sup>rd</sup>, 2024''
** 16 Team Swiss System Format
*** Rounds 2 to 5 are seeded using the {{Abbr|Buchholz system|Ranking based on opponents' performance}} & teams' initial seeds
*** Elimination and Advancement matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
*** All other matches are {{Abbr/Bo1}}
** Top 8 Teams proceed to the '''[[Perfect World/Major/2024/Shanghai/Elimination Stage|Elimination Stage]]'''
** Bottom 8 Teams are eliminated
** {{Swiss Explained|width=790px|margin=45px|seeding=** The initial match-ups are seeded using the pre-determined "Next Major Slot" rankings.}}

