* Top 8 Teams proceed to '''[[StarLadder/2025/Major/Stage 2|Stage 2]]'''
* Bottom 8 Teams are eliminated
* {{Swiss Explained|width=790px|margin=45px|seeding=** The initial match-ups are seeded using teams' ranking on the Valve Global Standings.}}

