==Format==
* '''16 Team Swiss System:''' ''December 4<sup>th</sup> – 7<sup>th</sup>, 2025''
** Rounds 2 to 5 are seeded using the {{Abbr|Buchholz system|Ranking based on opponents' performance}} & teams' initial seeds
** Elimination and Advancement matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** All other matches are {{Abbr/Bo1}}
* Top 8 Teams proceed to the '''[[StarLadder/2025/Major/Playoffs|Playoffs]]'''
* Bottom 8 Teams are eliminated
* {{Swiss Explained|width=790px|margin=45px|seeding=
** The initial match-ups are seeded using the below seeding:
*** Invited teams are seeded 1st–8th using their ranking on the Valve Global Standings.
*** Teams from Stage 2 are seeded 9th–16th using their Swiss & Buchholz scores from Stage 2.
}}

